{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":39,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴比伦王的使节"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那时，巴比伦王巴拉但的儿子米罗达·巴拉但听见希西家病而痊愈，就送书信和礼物给他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["希西家喜欢见使者，就把自己宝库的金子、银子、香料、贵重的膏油，和他武库的一切军器，并所有的财宝都给他们看；他家中和全国之内，希西家没有一样不给他们看的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["于是先知以赛亚来见希西家王，问他说：「这些人说什么？他们从哪里来见你？」希西家说：「他们从远方的巴比伦来见我。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["以赛亚说：「他们在你家里看见了什么？」希西家说：「凡我家中所有的，他们都看见了；我财宝中没有一样不给他们看的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["以赛亚对希西家说：「你要听万军之耶和华的话："]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["日子必到，凡你家里所有的，并你列祖积蓄到如今的，都要被掳到巴比伦去，不留下一样；这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["并且从你本身所生的众子，其中必有被掳去、在巴比伦王宫里当太监的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["希西家对以赛亚说：「你所说耶和华的话甚好，因为在我的年日中必有太平和稳固的景况。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/39.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/40.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/38.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}